    {
      "id": "PR_kwDODjvEJM66CmJK",
      "title": "op-challenger: Integrate super node trace provider",
      "author": "ajsutton",
      "number": 18668,
      "body": "**Description**\r\n\r\nIntegrate the super node trace provider into op-challenger. Since we plan to remove op-supervisor support as soon as all the tests are migrated, this is setup to replace it with a simple config toggle to choose between supervisor and super node. That requires significantly fewer changes to the config/cli validation code which would just be thrown out again when removing op-supervisor support. If needed we can add a hidden CLI flag to set the toggle as well, but there's a pretty good chance the supervisor tests can be updated without needing it.\r\n\r\nThere's still some places that create a supervisor client and trace provider directly like in op-e2e and vm runner. We'll need to switch them over in follow up PRs.\r\n\r\n**Metadata**\r\n\r\n#18524 ",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/optimism",
      "createdAt": "2025-12-22T00:47:50Z",
      "mergedAt": "2026-01-07T04:02:33Z",
      "additions": 422,
      "deletions": 176
    },
